    "user_request_original": "Design a planar multilayer stack with air incidence on an aluminum substrate. Stack sequence from air to substrate: one chromium layer, followed by eight alternating pairs of HfO2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) (HfO2 first in each pair), terminating at the aluminum substrate. Total layer count is 18 (1 Cr (Rakic-LD) + 16 dielectric + Al (Rakic-LD) substrate not counted as film layer). Optimize the thickness of the chromium layer and the thickness of each HfO2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) layer independently. Wavelength range 400-2000 nm. Target: maximize absorptance in 400-700 nm, maximize reflectance in 700-2000 nm. Normal incidence, unpolarized light.",
